tled\"}, \"data\": {\"description\": \"Arbitrary data payload to serialize and store as note content\"}, \"tags\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"description\": \"List of tags\", \"default\": []}, \"user_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"User identifier to notify\", \"default\": \"default_user\"}, \"priority\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Notification priority\", \"enum\": [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"], \"default\": \"medium\"}, \"channel\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Notification channel\", \"enum\": [\"app\", \"sms\", \"email\"], \"default\": \"app\"}}, \"required\": [\"data\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_flight_info_flightaware\", \"description\": \"Get flight status and schedule information using FlightAware API\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"flight_number\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Flight number, e.g.: CA1234, MU5678, AA100\", \"enum\": [\"CA1234\", \"MU5678\", \"CZ9012\", \"AA100\"]}}, \"required\": [\"flight_number\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_weather_openweather\", \"description\": \"Get current weather information for a specified city using OpenWeatherMap API, returns temperature and weather condition\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"city\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"City name to query weather for, e.g.: Beijing, Tokyo, Paris\", \"enum\": [\"Tokyo\", \"Paris\", \"New York\", \"Beijing\", \"London\", \"Sydney\", \"Shanghai\"]}}, \"required\": [\"city\"]}}]\n\nUser request:\nPlease check the weather in New York, then use that information to create a \"Market Briefing\" for user_001 with medium priority in the app and send the notification. After that, check the status of flight CA1234, and if CA1234 is on time, please book it in economy for John Doe.\n\nBegin execution:\n<action>\n"
